    "description": "Located on a quiet block in the heart of the Excelsior neighborhood, steps away from the natural beauty of McLaren Park, this location offers both urban convenience and outdoor recreation. Step inside a welcoming living room, where a large double-paned front-facing window fills the space with natural light & beautifully refinished original oak wood floors. Adjacent to the living area, the remodeled eat-in kitchen offers updated cabinetry, quartz counters, tile flooring, and stainless steel appliances. Two generous bedrooms and a beautifully remodeled bathroom with/ skylight complete the main level. The lower level features a generous storage area and a flexible bonus family room/ office space. Designed for California living, the custom sun-drenched backyard features a multi-level green area and professional hardscaping ideal for gathering & entertaining.  Don't miss this excellent opportunity to create a home perfectly suits your lifestyle in one of the city's most vibrant neighborhoods."
